{"parse": {"title": "10TH-05", "pageid": 105715, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/10TH-04\" title=\"10TH-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">10TH-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/10TH-06\" title=\"10TH-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">10TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.B8.83.E9.B2.81.E5.9B.BE.E6.96.AF.E5.9C.A8.E5.91.A2.E5.96.83\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"布鲁图斯在呢喃\">布鲁图斯在呢喃</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 布鲁图斯在呢喃</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Et tu, Brute?</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>亲<span class=\"color-value\"></span>爱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>背<span class=\"color-value\"></span>叛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>者<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>受<span class=\"color-value\"></span>赐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>黄<span class=\"color-value\"></span>金<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11005</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_shibimigong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_shibimigong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“嗖——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一支铅制的细箭直戳入胆囊中，胆汁四溅，血肉模糊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-624911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-624911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-624911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>……接近半数……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的使徒脸色苍白，气若游丝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-624911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-624911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-624911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>……接近半数的马格努斯潜艇已沉没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>大声一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>拿掉你那矜贵的做派，“淑女”。我不是那些需要你惺惺作态拉拢的蠢货。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-624910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-624910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-624910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-624901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-624901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-624901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>接近半数的马格努斯潜艇已沉没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这才像话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铅制的箭头重新对准另一个标靶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>终于——迂腐的白家伙终于拿出了一点动真格的反应……谢天谢地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一箭射出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冻紫的溃肉流出臭烂的脂肪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>——若非如此，所有人都要匍匐在那位“传道者”的脚边，为她的“无所不能”所倾倒了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年迈的步伐拖着素色布缎走向标靶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-524020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“神秘岛屿的优秀除错师”“秘之教诲者沉睡后唯一的领导者”“伟大仪式的最高主持者”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“噗嗤——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>禽类头骨中镶嵌的晶状球体被捏碎成泥。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_huanxingguangchang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>只不过是错误的人出现在了对的时机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>能听到秘之教诲者的声音？呵！编造出这样的谎言，使得所有人都相信她，臣服她……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>有些人守在后方圣地统筹仪式所需的一切，有些人却全世界“布道”。人心、权力都被她握在手里，出尽风头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>物资运输、人员调配，甚至重塑伟大的历史……一个新上任的小姑娘能了解多少？没有我的帮助，她什么也不是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>噢，我不是在说你。但你最好也夹紧尾巴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>虽然你带来了重要的仪式材料，但“自由海风号”上的事闹出了太大动静，现在全世界的目光都聚在南半球，这都要拜你所赐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>我从最开始就不支持将权力交给你们这些毫无根基之人。自大，冒进，不知收敛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>基金会的军队马上要突破第一道防线了，如果再长驱直入——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>他们不会一直保持这样的势头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话头被粗暴地打断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>南极不是他们该来的地方，再派多少铁家伙也是一样。现在才举兵进攻，不过是为了证明自己并非全无计划罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>……您说的没错，我们无需费心关注注定溃败的蝼蚁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>作为仪式外围应援的我们，眼下必须着眼于让仪式顺利进行……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>你那浅薄的眼里一次只能看见一件事吗？你如何能保证我们的内部是滴水不漏的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻使徒的呼吸变得更轻，她竭尽全力让自己显得更加谦卑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>您是指……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>那位将军的近卫团动向如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>伊戈尔军？他们已经在海岸多处建起了防线，目前正在警戒可能出现的基金会游兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>可笑的墙头草，如何能够侍奉吾辈伟大的复苏之母？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>将那些人安插在圣地之上，本身就是一种侮辱和背叛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>但传道者对他们表示出了极高的尊重，何况，他们为仪式带来了最关键的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>愚钝！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>他们甚至不愿意接受神圣的试炼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>与一群未受祝福与引导的庸人为伍，是重塑之手自立于世间以来最大的耻辱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-624910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-624910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-624910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">淑女格蕾丝：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>罢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>一切以仪式为重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"524010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"524010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-524010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-524010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尼姆斯：</div><div>一切——以伟大的复苏之母为重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>禽类可怜的残骸被扔在了年轻使徒的脚边。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_zhudi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_zhudi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>营帐已经扎下，但疲乏仍未消退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机长从直升飞机里探出半个身子，对着帐篷前的女士摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">机长：</div><div>已经执行过一次检查程序了，中尉，最大的问题出在脚蹬上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">机长：</div><div>由于未知原因，脚蹬控制的偏航角速率未能达到设定的预期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">机长：</div><div>这就是刚才飞行过程中出现了强烈颠簸和航向偏转的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">机长：</div><div>在得到一次充分完整的检修前，“小犬号”是不适宜再起飞了，特别是在南极这么恶劣的环境下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔回头看了一眼已经安置下的士兵，走向了这架载量二十人的运输直升机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>向将军报告我们的情况……虽然距离指定的驻扎地还有些距离，但目前看来只能这样了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>所幸这片空地同样有开阔的视野，足够我们执行任务……你完成了一次完美的迫降，辛苦了，丹尼洛夫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"525501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"525501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/HeadIconSmall-525501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-525501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">机长：</div><div>这是我应该做的，中尉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>接下来要做的，只有等待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等待什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>答案呼之欲出。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_zhudi\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_zhudi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_zhudi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>全体注意，以下是自伊戈尔将军的指令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>我们需要在这里坚守冰洲的外围防线，以应对基金会的任何进攻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>同驻扎在另外一个港口的托勒密步兵班一起，由坐守仪式神殿的将军下达机动调令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫莉德尔调整了一下领口，她感到口干。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>一旦发现任何单位进入可视范围内的海域，一律视为交火信号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众士兵：</div><div>是——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵们齐声回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她扫视士兵一圈，而后低下头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看着自己浸湿的军靴上迷人的金色落雪，她眨了眨眼。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "10TH-05"}}